    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>To give paladins with Cleric Training and rangers with Ranger Ex Cathedral a chance to use the new material, allow PCs with these talents access to the spells of the following domains:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Paladin</strong>: Good, Justice, Protection, Strength, War</li>\n<li><strong>Ranger</strong>: Animal, Archery, Freedom, Plant</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Paladins can also gain access to any domain with the Divine Domain talent.</p>\n<p>Note that this is a default selection for PCs who fit the archetype of that class. Based on backgrounds, race, icon relationships or One Unique Thing there may be domains that fit better. Talk to your GM.</p>"
    },
